|            Standard MG94             |  -4354.51  |    1.1464  |    N/A     |                N/A                 |    N/A     |                N/A                 |
|        Standard MG94 + 2 hits        |  -4295.30  |    0.9469  |    0.4614  |       0.0000 (2-hit rate = 0)      |    N/A     |                N/A                 |
